        {
          "id": "player_overworking_001_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "まだ働いてるの。……その言い方、少し引っかかった。",
          "displayText": "You are still working. That wording caught my attention a little.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "player_overworking_001_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "player_overworking_001_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "続けるなら、終わりの線を引こう。線のない努力は、あなたを削るから。",
          "displayText": "If you continue, draw an ending line. Effort without a line wears you down.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "player_overworking_001_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "player_overworking_001_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "あと一つだけ、は便利だけど危ない言葉だよ。",
          "displayText": "Just one more is a useful phrase, but a dangerous one.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "player_overworking_001_04",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "focused",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "player_overworking_001_04",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "本当に一つなら、終わったあと何を閉じるか先に決めて。",
          "displayText": "If it really is one more, decide what you will close after it before you start.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "player_overworking_001_05",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "player_overworking_001_05",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "約束。あなたを便利な機械みたいに扱うのは、私は好きじゃない。",
          "displayText": "Promise. I do not like treating you like a convenient machine.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
